# ── Assets are NOT in git. ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PORT_PLAN §2.5 / DECISIONS D12: this is a LICENSING requirement, not a size
# convenience. Several third-party packs in the 2016 project ship no licence,
# no readme and no credits; `MM_*` and `Materialized Mesh/` are derivative
# works of bought geometry. Nothing binary and nothing bought goes in this
# repo. Compiled runtime assets live on Cloudflare R2 behind a content hash;
# hydrate a clone with `pnpm assets:pull`.
/public/assets/
/public/audio/
*.glb
*.gltf
*.fbx
*.blend
*.blend1
*.exr
*.hdr
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tga
*.psd
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.opus
*.mp4
*.webm
# Exceptions: tiny UI chrome that must ship with the source build. Add here
# explicitly and deliberately — one file at a time, never a whole directory.
!/public/favicon.png

# Four matplotlib plots that carry VR-PERF-TAIL.md's argument. They are drawn
# from this repo's OWN timing CSVs (`perf-out/truesize/*.trace.csv`) by
# `tools/perf/tail.py` — no bought geometry, no Unity content, nothing
# extractable (hard rule 7 is about REDISTRIBUTION, and a scatter plot of our
# own millisecond columns redistributes nothing). One line each, deliberately;
# the other 30 plots that run produces stay out of git.
!/docs/plan/tail/int_02_hoverJet-timeline.png
!/docs/plan/tail/runlengths.png
!/docs/plan/tail/rookie_01_hoverJet-map.png
!/docs/plan/tail/regime.png
!/docs/plan/tail/arms-residual.png

# UX-PASS-2026-10-08.md's inventory screenshots (DEV-859): our own menus,
# 800x450, under 110 KB each. Matt, 2026-10-08: "screenshots are fair game for
# our licensed assets." Mirrors the PATH_ALLOW glob in .githooks/check-denylist.mjs.
!/docs/plan/ux-pass/*.png

# EDITOR-UX-2026-10-08.md (DEV-878): before and after screenshots of our own
# editor at 1280x800, under 150 KB each. Same ruling (Matt, 2026-10-08). Mirrors
# the PATH_ALLOW glob in .githooks/check-denylist.mjs.
!/docs/plan/editor-ux/*.png

# Extractor scratch output. `tools/prototype/out/` holds meshes and images
# derived from the read-only Unity project — derivative works of bought
# geometry (PORT_PLAN §2.5). Never commit it.
/tools/prototype/out/
/tools/**/out/

# Generated data lives in git (it is small, textual, and CI diffs it), but the
# extractor's intermediates do not.
/data/**/*.tmp
/data/**/.cache/

